{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Doki Doki Forever","artist":"OR3O feat. rachie, Chi-Chi, Kathy-chan★","date":"2026-07-14","sourceId":"YzJm-mk52WM:028","sourceHash":"bc54de27fe4fe218529896009c44397e3770848e13feb8130e670383b384956e","duration":184.09999999999854,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.887397,"end":16.795,"text":"Doki Doki!","translation":"두근두근","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.95727,"end":17.684131,"text":"Hey hey!","translation":"헤이 헤이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":17.847164,"end":20.345,"text":"My heart's beating when I'm hanging out with you!","translation":"너와 함께 있으면 내 심장이 뛰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":21.83669,"end":23.608414,"text":"Why does my heart ache,","translation":"왜 가슴이 아픈 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":23.646474,"end":25.755,"text":"When I hear you feel the same way too?","translation":"너도 같은 마음이란 걸 들으면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":26.096183,"end":27.958765,"text":"(Eheheh)","translation":"에헤헤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":28.075948,"end":29.345,"text":"Just like a sundae,","translation":"선데이처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":29.73575,"end":32.085,"text":"It's sweet every time I teach you something new!","translation":"새로운 걸 가르쳐 줄 때마다 달콤해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":33.385316,"end":34.203035,"text":"Is this by chance,","translation":"이건 우연일까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":34.335203,"end":35.255,"text":"Or fate?","translation":"운명일까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":35.475068,"end":37.610223,"text":"Whenever it's just me and you?","translation":"너와 나만 있을 때마다","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":37.704803,"end":39.930815,"text":"(E-Eh! Don't get the wrong idea!)","translation":"에 에헴 오해하지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":39.954535,"end":44.915,"text":"When we touch, it'll never be enough","translation":"닿아도 절대 부족할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":45.153917,"end":51.285,"text":"Is it way too much if you had to choose just one of us?","translation":"우리 중 하나만 골라야 한다면 너무한 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":51.453168,"end":53.235,"text":"Tell me, tell me, please!","translation":"말해줘 말해줘 제발","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":53.712899,"end":55.022741,"text":"Is this what I think,","translation":"내 생각이 맞는 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":55.042741,"end":56.71254,"text":"Or is it just me?","translation":"나만 이런 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":56.73254,"end":59.003982,"text":"Don't wake me up from this sweet little dream!","translation":"이 달콤한 작은 꿈에서 깨우지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":59.322232,"end":61.457387,"text":"Where we'll be together forever","translation":"우린 영원히 함께할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":61.541968,"end":63.359122,"text":"We're never gonna be apart!","translation":"절대 떨어지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":63.391748,"end":64.41,"text":"Will it be okay","translation":"괜찮을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":64.43,"end":67.84,"text":"If I express my love for you this way?","translation":"이렇게 너에게 사랑을 전해도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":68.07,"end":70.705,"text":"No matter what you do or what you say,","translation":"네가 뭘 하든 무슨 말을 하든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":71.15,"end":72.921724,"text":"We'll be together forever","translation":"우린 영원히 함께할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":72.98,"end":75.6,"text":"We're never gonna be apart!","translation":"절대 떨어지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":78.77,"end":81.27,"text":"(We're never gonna be apart)","translation":"절대 떨어지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":86.668981,"end":87.74885,"text":"Hey hey","translation":"헤이 헤이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":87.76885,"end":90.265,"text":"When I'm next to you, I don't know what to do","translation":"네 곁에 있으면 어쩔 줄 모르겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":91.448412,"end":93.356423,"text":"Why does it feel so great,","translation":"왜 이렇게 좋은 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":93.39818,"end":95.487907,"text":"When our eyes meet out of the blue?","translation":"갑자기 눈이 마주치면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":95.527927,"end":97.799369,"text":"(I-I'm sorry, I said too much!)","translation":"미 미안 너무 많이 말했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":97.827654,"end":98.365,"text":"I really Lͭ̉͡'͓̣O̴̱̳̱ͭ̈́͞ͅṾ̛̤̉̉̓͡ͅȆ̿'̷͇̙—-","translation":"난 정말 사","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":98.847532,"end":102.005,"text":"The way you write even when you don't have a clue!","translation":"네가 아무것도 몰라도 쓰는 모습이 좋아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":103.177018,"end":104.948742,"text":"I wanna hear you say:","translation":"네 입으로 듣고 싶어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":105.266769,"end":110.036796,"text":"\"This love that I am feeling is true!\"","translation":"내가 느끼는 이 사랑은 진심이라고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":110.086196,"end":114.947081,"text":"Tasty love, something I want more of!","translation":"맛있는 사랑 더 원해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":114.975615,"end":117.595,"text":"Will it make the cut,","translation":"우리 중 하나만 골라야 한다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":117.855272,"end":121.489579,"text":"If you had to choose just one of us?","translation":"선택받을 수 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":121.524836,"end":122.895,"text":"Shall I leave you be?","translation":"그냥 널 내버려 둘까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":123.474604,"end":126.554235,"text":"Is it love if I can set you free?","translation":"널 놓아줄 수 있다면 사랑일까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":126.574235,"end":128.615,"text":"But even if it's not reality,","translation":"하지만 현실이 아니어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":129.013945,"end":131.058243,"text":"Let's be together forever,","translation":"우리 영원히 함께하자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":131.083699,"end":133.033465,"text":"We're never gonna be apart!","translation":"절대 떨어지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":133.053465,"end":134.905,"text":"How can I convey,","translation":"어떻게 전할까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":135.173213,"end":137.725,"text":"My love for you before they fly away?","translation":"그들이 날아가기 전에 내 사랑을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":138.162857,"end":140.843158,"text":"I think about it all day everyday","translation":"하루 종일 매일 생각해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":140.872535,"end":142.689688,"text":"We'll be together forever,","translation":"우리 영원히 함께할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":142.722315,"end":144.85747,"text":"We're never gonna be apart!","translation":"절대 떨어지지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":144.882059,"end":147.880361,"text":"One by one they only","translation":"하나씩 하나씩 모두","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":147.901699,"end":149.945997,"text":"Fall apart","translation":"무너져 가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":149.971453,"end":152.255,"text":"Can it be undone?","translation":"되돌릴 수 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":152.391166,"end":156.65,"text":"Why can't I just be the one for once?","translation":"왜 난 한 번쯤 선택받을 수 없을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":164.22,"end":166.069537,"text":"We'll be together forever,","translation":"우리 영원히 함께할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":166.089537,"end":168.31,"text":"We're never gonna be Aͯͮ'̣P͉͐A̿ͫͥ'͊͡R͚͞'͓̦̼'͖T̑'","translation":"절대 떨ㅇ","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":170.908964,"end":175.83,"text":"(Forever, forever)","translation":"영원히 영원히","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":175.85,"end":177.7,"text":"Maybe we'll never be together,","translation":"어쩌면 우린 함께하지 못해도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":177.72,"end":180.9,"text":"But forever you'll be in my heart!","translation":"영원히 넌 내 마음속에 있을 거야","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}